<title>USA: UNIFIED SEWER, ORE., $90 MLN BONDS REPRICED.</title>
<headline>UNIFIED SEWER, ORE., $90 MLN BONDS REPRICED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Wednesday it repriced Unified Sewerage Agency, Ore.'s $90 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The top yield at the repricing was 5.10 percent in 2012.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
